WEBVTT

00:10:28.916 --> 00:10:32.753
And I can't get his words exactly right,
but Chris basically said,

00:10:33.545 --> 00:10:38.342
"Forgiveness is more powerful
than people realize,

00:10:38.384 --> 00:10:42.388
because it lifts all of this
stuff off of you.

00:10:42.429 --> 00:10:45.724
It's freedom -- freedom from revenge,

00:10:45.766 --> 00:10:47.810
freedom from anger,

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.895
freedom from hatred."

00:10:51.397 --> 00:10:54.358
Sadly, he was called out for saying that.

00:10:56.735 --> 00:11:00.447
I believe that it's very possible
to use these strategies,